1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:05,740
Here is how a three thousand dollar credit card balance can take eleven years to pay off.

2
00:00:06,090 --> 00:00:10,984
Say your card charges twenty two percent interest, and you pay sixty dollars a month.

3
00:00:11,334 --> 00:00:17,531
At first, about fifty five dollars of that sixty is just interest. Only five dollars touches the debt.

4
00:00:17,881 --> 00:00:24,775
Keep paying sixty a month, and it takes over eleven years. You pay about eight thousand two hundred dollars in total.

5
00:00:25,125 --> 00:00:31,515
Pay a hundred and fifty a month instead, and it is gone in just over two years, for about thirty eight hundred.

6
00:00:31,865 --> 00:00:36,647
So pay more than the minimum every month, and tackle your highest interest debt first.

7
00:00:36,997 --> 00:00:40,260
Interest is great when you earn it, and painful when you pay it.
